<title>POLAND: BPH MAY NET FALLS TO PLN 19.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>BPH MAY NET FALLS TO PLN 19.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY						  1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 19.30 vs   24.12</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   33.35 vs   35.47</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 61.69 vs   56.59</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     103.99 vs   88.10</p>
<p> JANUARY-MAY					 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					114.22 vs  130.09</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				  179.66 vs  190.20</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		309.79 vs  280.56</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     498.63 vs  431.30</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank</p>
<p>Przemyslowo-Handlowy SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
